---
const steps = [
  {
    n: "01",
    title: "Deposit once",
    body: "Your tokens move into the market's vaults and your seat is credited. From then on trading touches no token accounts at all, which is most of why it is cheap.",
  },
  {
    n: "02",
    title: "Quote or take",
    body: "Orders rest in a red-black tree keyed by price and arrival, so priority is price-time on both sides. A maker replaces an entire two-sided ladder in one instruction.",
  },
  {
    n: "03",
    title: "Settle in the same instruction",
    body: "A taker's order matches and both balances move before the transaction ends. There is no crank, no event queue, and no second step that can fail after the first succeeded.",
  },
];
---

<section class="band" id="how">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="band-head">
      <p class="tag reveal">How it settles</p>
      <h2 class="display reveal" style="--delay:60ms">
        Serum Needed A Crank.<br /><span class="dim">This Does Not.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="--delay:120ms">
        The first generation of on-chain order books matched in one transaction and settled
        in another, driven by an off-chain process. When that process stalled, the exchange
        stalled. Everything here happens in one instruction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      {
        steps.map((step, index) => (
          <li class="step reveal" style={`--delay:${index * 90}ms`}>
            <span class="num n">{step.n}</span>
            <h3>{step.title}</h3>
            <p>{step.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ink-1) 0%, var(--ink-2) 100%);
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 17rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    background: var(--ink-2);
    transition: background-color 0.4s var(--ease);
  }

  .step:hover {
    background: var(--card-2);
  }

  .n {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .step p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }
</style>
